  "description": "Fuel your child's appetite for adventure with this 18 inch kids bike for boys and girls aged 4 to 7. Designed with a sleek silver-gray frame highlighted by bold orange and black splatter paint graphics across the frame, fork, head tube, and full chain guard, this bicycle brings a cool street-style look to every ride. Built for growing kids between 41 and 53 inches tall, it features tool-free adjustable seat and handlebar heights. No more hesitation during balance transitions or scary stops—sturdy removable training wheels and an included kickstand allow easy switching as skills develop, while front and rear dual V-brakes deliver responsive stopping control. Complete with a heavy-duty steel frame, front and rear mudguards, a full chain guard, and wear-resistant rubber tires, this 16-inch bike is built for confidence on every neighborhood trail.\nDYNAMIC SPLATTER GRAPHICS: Features eye-catching orange splatter paint graphics on the frame, fork, and chain guard over a silver frame, delivering a cool street-style look.",
